{"meta":{"id":"tt43339903","type":"series","name":"Juuou Mujin Dandivine","imdb_id":"tt43339903","description":"Hace 20 años, el robot combinador Dandivine derrotó a los misteriosos invasores conocidos como Aposdoll. La empresa de fabricación de juguetes Kasuga celebró la victoria de la humanidad al convertir Dandivine en una línea de juguetes popular, pero la mala gestión y la excesiva dependencia de la línea Dandivine han empujado a la compañía al borde de la bancarrota, causando que el presidente de la compañía Kasuga, Genjuro Shijima, desee el renacimiento de Dandivine, incluso si eso significa perturbar el estado pacífico del mundo.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt43339903.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v4HLZ8FsBeYPjMBQZ1JFgrhkhG8.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nBHBdJyw5tZXQW0U4KhoZkJOqrQ.png","genres":["Animación","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"5.9","country":"Japan","cast":["寺島拓篤","白石晴香","会沢紗弥","東山奈央","山根綺","久野美咲","泊明日菜","小西克幸","Ryōtarō Okiayu","斧アツシ","青木瑠璃子"],"writer":["井上敏樹"],"trailers":[{"source":"TAGGia6tbgU","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"TAGGia6tbgU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"TAGGia6tbgU","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"5.9","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt43339903"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"寺島拓篤","cate